cJTAG for ARM's CMSIS-DAP: DAP_JTAG_Format and DAP_JTAG_Escape, with the OScan1, OScan2, OScan5
and OScan6 scan formats, as proposed on ARM-software/CMSIS-DAP#8. The ARM reference build
(SWD_CODEGEN and JTAG_CODEGEN off) applies it to a copy of external/CMSIS-DAP's v2.1.2 sources.

Made in the port's repository with:
  git diff v2.1.2 cjtag -- Firmware/Include/DAP.h Firmware/Source/DAP.c Firmware/Source/JTAG_DP.c

